              "audioEnd": 98.588
            },
            {
              "text": "The girl used her golden fruit to trade with the woman.",
              "audioStart": 99.45,
              "audioEnd": 101.987
            },
            {
              "text": "Then she washed the spots off the shirt as only a true love could do.",
              "audioStart": 102.85,
              "audioEnd": 106.138
            },
            {
              "text": "The magic spell broke completely.",
              "audioStart": 107,
              "audioEnd": 108.862
            },
            {
              "text": "The man and his love escaped together and lived happily after.",
              "audioStart": 109.725,
              "audioEnd": 112.975
            },
            {
              "text": "The story of the bear and the girl is very famous.",
              "audioStart": 113.838,
              "audioEnd": 116.375
            },
            {
              "text": "Many people read the tale in books during the winter season.",
              "audioStart": 117.237,
              "audioEnd": 120.112
            },
            {
              "text": "The mother and her child lived in a poor house before the journey began.",
              "audioStart": 120.975,
              "audioEnd": 124.375
            },
            {
              "text": "Money was important for the family to survive.",
              "audioStart": 125.237,
              "audioEnd": 127.638
            },
            {
              "text": "When the white bear arrived, the young girl made a big decision.",
              "audioStart": 128.5,
              "audioEnd": 131.625
            },
            {
              "text": "She left her home and traveled far away into the cold mountains.",
              "audioStart": 132.488,
              "audioEnd": 135.662
            },
            {
              "text": "Every evening, the animal became a man who talked to her in the dark room.",
              "audioStart": 136.525,
              "audioEnd": 140.375
            },
            {
              "text": "She felt happy with him until the secret was broken.",
              "audioStart": 141.238,
              "audioEnd": 143.875
            },
            {
              "text": "The small light changed everything between them.",
              "audioStart": 144.738,
              "audioEnd": 147.075
            },
            {
              "text": "When the drops fell upon his skin, he woke up and told her the truth.",
              "audioStart": 147.938,
              "audioEnd": 151.525
            },
            {
              "text": "He had to travel to a distant castle far away.",
              "audioStart": 152.387,
              "audioEnd": 154.9
            },
            {
              "text": "The girl did not stop because she loved him deeply.",
              "audioStart": 155.762,
              "audioEnd": 158.338
            },
            {
              "text": "She walked through many places and met helpful women along the road.",
              "audioStart": 159.2,
              "audioEnd": 162.65
            },
            {
              "text": "They gave her wonderful items to help her cross the water and the mountains.",
              "audioStart": 163.512,
              "audioEnd": 167.088
            },
            {
              "text": "When she reached the high castle, she found the man again.",
              "audioStart": 167.95,
              "audioEnd": 170.9
            },
            {
              "text": "She used her golden fruit and washed the shirt to break the spell.",
              "audioStart": 171.762,
              "audioEnd": 174.875
            },
            {
              "text": "True love won the day, and they were free at last.",
              "audioStart": 175.738,
              "audioEnd": 178.512
            },
            {
              "text": "They left the castle and returned to a wonderful life together.",
              "audioStart": 179.375,
              "audioEnd": 182.475
            },
            {
              "text": "Every person in the country heard about their amazing adventure.",
              "audioStart": 183.338,
              "audioEnd": 186.35
            },
            {
              "text": "The mother was glad that her child found happiness in the end.",
              "audioStart": 187.213,
              "audioEnd": 190.287
            },
            {
              "text": "Years later, people still told the story of the bear and the castle.",
              "audioStart": 191.15,
              "audioEnd": 194.625
            },
            {
              "text": "It remained a favorite tale for children and adults too.",
              "audioStart": 195.488,
              "audioEnd": 198.3
            },
            {
              "text": "Love can overcome any difficult problem if people stay true to their promises.",
              "audioStart": 199.162,
              "audioEnd": 203.3
            },
            {
              "text": "The journey was long, but the result brought peace and joy.",
              "audioStart": 204.162,
              "audioEnd": 207.125
            },
            {
              "text": "Even now, readers enjoy the magic of this old story.",
              "audioStart": 207.988,
              "audioEnd": 211.025
            },
            {
              "text": "Life is full of strange turns, just like the path across the mountains.",
              "audioStart": 211.887,
              "audioEnd": 215.613
            },
            {
              "text": "We learn that breaking a promise can lead to great trouble.",
              "audioStart": 216.475,
              "audioEnd": 219.213
            },
            {
              "text": "However, true love and hard work can fix almost anything.",
              "audioStart": 220.075,
              "audioEnd": 223.512
            },
            {
              "text": "The girl showed great strength during her long and difficult travel.",
              "audioStart": 224.375,
              "audioEnd": 227.713
            },
            {
              "text": "She never gave up hope even when she was completely alone.",
              "audioStart": 228.575,
              "audioEnd": 231.475
            },
            {
              "text": "Her story continues to inspire readers all around the world today.",
              "audioStart": 232.338,
              "audioEnd": 235.8
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
